    {
      "tag": "BUTTON",
      "id": "",
      "text": "01\nSTATED\n↗\nCore owns lifetime; TypeScript owns meaning.\nOne scope per semantic service, with six isolated caches. The service still holds the scope instance. Algorithms, prepared ",
      "href": null,
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "tag": "BUTTON",
      "id": "",
      "text": "02\nSTATED\n↗\nKeep each answer’s identity and key space.\nFive caches hold promises by symbol identity; one holds locations by file + position. Hits preserve exact values and empty ar",
      "href": null,
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "tag": "BUTTON",
      "id": "",
      "text": "03\nSTATED\n↗\nOnly a successful refresh starts a turn.\nBoth versions clear after refresh succeeds, including an unchanged snapshot. A failed refresh leaves the current semantic cache",
      "href": null,
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "tag": "BUTTON",
      "id": "",
      "text": "04\nSTATED\n↗\nClear immediately. Then wait for project release.\nBoth versions clear first. The new service returns Promise<void> and the backend awaits it: pending release stays pend",
      "href": null,
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "tag": "BUTTON",
      "id": "",
      "text": "05\nSTATED\n↗\nKeep rejected promises; retry a factory that throws.\nA returned promise is cached even if it rejects. A synchronous throw occurs before insertion and can be retried. Cl",
      "href": null,
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "tag": "BUTTON",
      "id": "",
      "text": "06\nUNEXPLAINED\n↗\nExpose small, reusable handles.\nCore exports the scope and getOrCreate interface. Handles survive repeated clears; there is no public per-key invalidation, disposa",
      "href": null,
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "tag": "BUTTON",
      "id": "",
      "text": "07\nUNEXPLAINED\n↗\nPass files instead of the whole snapshot.\nThe exported semantic service changes beginTurn(snapshot) to beginTurn(files: readonly WorkspaceFile[]). The backend pass",
      "href": null,
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "tag": "BUTTON",
      "id": "",
      "text": "08\nSTATED\n↗\nAdd evidence around identity and lifecycle.\nSix semantic-service cases and four core cases are added. The five existing service cases and their assertions remain. No de",
      "href": null,
      "visible": true
    },
